    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "When the guardians of the grid raised the alarm in the Visayas island region, they faced a crisis mounted as units fell. The critical failure of a key defender—a major power plant unit—demanded a heroic response from the grid operator and emergency responders, who took decisive action to protect the grid through emergency load management. This left a massive power loss threatening the people, with blackout risks increasing across the affected region.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "why-2",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "result-0",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "A cascade of failures, beginning with generator failures and equipment malfunctions since May began, culminated in the failure incident of the fallen power source. This power plant outage forced the grid operator to issue a warning for the island region, placing it under a grid alert. Officials, acting as authorities, then managed the crisis to prevent a complete grid instability, though a generation shortfall left over 950 megawatts unavailable.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "why-1",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.82
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "An adversary that pushed the system to its limits—high power demand from a heatwave impact—joined ongoing operational issues to cripple the power fleet. The system's steward in the Philippines faced a threat of darkness looming over the region after significant capacity was lost. Officials, as decision-makers, issued an emergency warning and ordered load shedding as a grid stabilization action to combat the megawatt shortage, a heroic stand against the technical fault.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
